                <mxCell id="135" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;Used to export data using ProtoJSON to an endpoint. Because an exporter can serialize both logs and traces, it is responsible for managing an internal &quot;busy&quot; bit so that it doesn&#39;t have two requests to the same otlp collector going simultainously, thus internally syncronizing log and trace exports.&amp;nbsp; &amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;" style="text;strokeColor=default;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;rotatable=0;points=[[0,0.5],[1,0.5]];portConstraint=eastwest;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" parent="134" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry y="26" width="420" height="74" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
