                <mxCell id="156" value="&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 10px;&quot;&gt;Since serialization must occur for one or more records, I&#39;m making the method take the first node in a linked list from a processor. If the processor is a simple processor, meaning it forwards log records immediately for export, it must wrap the record a linked list of length 1.&lt;/font&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=1;strokeColor=default;arcSize=5;" parent="1" vertex="1">
